Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.09,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Listen to the cactus snap… and a surprise inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.47,0:00:12.55,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Fact one: Cactus contains a gel used in cosmetic products.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:21.08,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Fact two: ASMR relies on soft repetitive sounds to trigger a relaxing brain response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:29.37,CapEN,,0,0,0,,And fact three: A shocking moment in the first seconds boosts average watch time noticeably.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:52.95,CapEN,,0,0,0,,And tonight's takeaway in three touches. For your mind: Curiosity pushes us to try odd things even when they look strange. For your heart: The surprise moment creates a binge feeling and pure fun. For your soul: Savor the calm before the shock and realize the experience can be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:58.71,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Subscribe to Daousha now and drop the next video you want to see in the comments!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:04.77,CapEN,,0,0,0,,Follow Daousha — the next one is wilder!
